Kt3y9kg&oe=69F2098C"}, {"file_name": "Spin.png", "id": "1302877217402173", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392338_1302877220735506_6589252251697966130_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HF82htmbPagQ7kNvwHIsHK3&_nc_oc=AdqHKUtKps85GPWoSqQYLubgtnSHyipOpFqG65O_DGQoswLJYjNpzgRR6nIAd55S7sc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3AvaQJizoB6e9id9yG4Kyvdn75G51pHPgwlHTCIPxVJg&oe=69F1FA5B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HUHUHU.png", "id": "2035477956919467", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392314_2035477963586133_3759903070723388888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uAQo7Dj6NAYQ7kNvwGFj5_8&_nc_oc=Adpbv-Tz6Ywmj9jYqvh5MmFe85yDKZwEr62sPXaPS18XmaLGCoTguSwEUWSpAIJvFdw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2jo0Hic3Qt3KzqhON_81X_W1a5ogERqvTWatBOrC9oXw&oe=69F20825"}, "display_name": "VITRIOL - DEMO", "keywords": ["Physics", "Fast", "Shooter", "Heavy", "Retro"], "long_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\nFast and Loose - Long strides and Heavy Blows churn through the wretched horde with a freedom and ease VR is yet to experience.\n\nHand to Skull - Physics based Enemies and an in-depth elbow estimation system provide a physicality and presence to the combat which enhances gameplay beyond what was previously possible.\n\nBlood, Fire and Pillars of Smoke - Sinners malformed, The Righteous Risen. The Wrath of God in Iron Men. All this scored by a soundtrack that hits just as hard, drowned in a haze just as thick. ", "short_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Lee Wilson", "dev